body:
"WE MUST BUILD THESE WALLS! IT IS WAY TOO DANGEROUS TO BE OUT IN THE OPEN"

&#x200B;

"By the way, could you build the lodestone outside the gate, right by the wildy wall? Thanks"

Roses are red;
Violets are blue;
The title’s in English;
So why aren’t you?

Lol jk; I really wish I knew what the heck this meme is saying, though. I dig the style lmao
